 ## rates
 
 - `rates.quote(weight_kg, zone)`: price for a weight and zone
+
+## invoices
+
+- `invoices.escalate_invoice(invoice_id)`: hand a large unpaid invoice to collections by setting its status to "escalated"; returns the `Invoice` with `escalated_at` set. Takes the id of an existing invoice. Allowed status: "open". Only invoices whose amount is at least `settings.ESCALATION_MIN_AMOUNT` (500.00) can be escalated; no rounding applies. Emits `invoice.escalated`. Idempotent: an already-escalated invoice is returned unchanged and emits no event.
+  - `E_NOT_FOUND`: no invoice with that id
+  - `E_BAD_STATE`: invoice is not open (detail is the current status)
+  - `E_LIMIT`: amount is below 500.00
